   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "**Pika H3 Flex + Dials + de-rope \u2014 MiniMax H3**\n\nPass 1 is the 6-step Pika render (saved as `dials_pika_plain`). The de-rope pass finds stretches that move too fast for the frame rate, holds those frames, re-renders the slowed clip from inject 0.48 and maps it back to real time (`dials_pika_derope`). **Needs [ComfyUI-MAINodes](https://github.com/matlowai/ComfyUI-MAINodes).**\n\n**Audio:** the de-roped clip keeps pass 1's original soundtrack (H3 Audio Recover: *keep the original performance*).\n\n**Time** (1280x704, 141 frames, RTX PRO 6000 Max-Q): Pika alone ~1.5 min; Pika + de-rope ~5.5 min, about the same as one 25-step render of the base model without de-rope.\n\n**Motion dial on Pika** (1280x704, spellblade prompt, seed 42, one take per strength; camera-removed optical flow):\n- **+0.5**: +20 % motion, same scene.\n- **+1.0**: +23 %, still the same scene.\n- **+1.5 / +2.0**: about +90 %; the scene restages and characters morph.\n- **+3**: loses the prompt.\n\n**Evil** (off at 0): dread +0.5 to +1 darkens the scene and turns the characters menacing while keeping the prompt. Other flavours: pick another `h3_evil_*` file.\n\n**No background music:** write `non_diegetic_music: N/A` (Pika's prompt guide).\n\n**Models:** the LoRA is `loras/pika_h3_flex_fl2va_v1_bf16.safetensors` in [Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3) (same weights as [Pika-Labs/Pika-H3-Flex](https://huggingface.co/Pika-Labs/Pika-H3-Flex) `comfy/loras/`). Base model, text encoder and VAEs as in the other Dials workflows."
   ]
  },
